   "text": "In early 2024 LinkedIn's cap of 100 connection requests a week caught up with our client's funnel.\n\nLinkedIn was their core outreach. 72 hours later, it wasn't the only one.\n\nThe full story is in the pages. The short version: sometimes, the simplest tools are the most powerful.\n\nWhat would you do if your main channel got capped next week?",
   "first_comment": "The part I'd do differently: build the reply inbox first. We had outreach live on every channel in 72 hours, then spent another week building sheets just to read the answers.",
